        "query": "gr_summary(\"{RunTime}\")\n// Translate the summary display text without changing totals or compliance status.\n| extend Guardrail = case(Guardrail == \"All Guardrails\", \"Toutes les mesures de protection\", Guardrail == \"Mandatory Guardrails\", \"Mesures de protection obligatoires\", Guardrail == \"Recommended Guardrails\", \"Mesures de protection recommandées\", Guardrail)\n| project-rename ['Mesure de protection'] = ['Guardrail'], ['Nombre total d’articles'] = ['Total # Items'], ['Articles non conformes'] = ['NonCompliant Items'], ['Articles à l’état inconnu'] = ['Unknown Items'], ['Statut'] = ['Status']",
